<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Automation và Observability on AWS FCJ Capstone Report - Nguyễn Ngọc Tuấn Khanh</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/5-tu-dong-hoa-va-giam-sat/</link><description>Recent content in Automation và Observability on AWS FCJ Capstone Report - Nguyễn Ngọc Tuấn Khanh</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/5-tu-dong-hoa-va-giam-sat/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Tạo EventBridge Scheduler cho Daily Ingestion</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/5-tu-dong-hoa-va-giam-sat/5.1-schedule-daily-ingestion/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/5-tu-dong-hoa-va-giam-sat/5.1-schedule-daily-ingestion/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Scheduler khởi chạy Glue Python Shell Job hằng ngày. Không cấu hình scheduler chạy cùng lúc transform/publisher vì cần đợi Raw output hoàn chỉnh.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Bước&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Hành động&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Chi tiết kỹ thuật&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;EventBridge → Scheduler → &lt;strong&gt;Create schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Tạo recurring schedule&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Schedule name&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;stock-screener-daily-ingestion&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Schedule pattern&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn cron-based schedule&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Expression&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Ví dụ &lt;code&gt;cron(0 7 ? * TUE-SAT *)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Timezone&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn &lt;code&gt;Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh&lt;/code&gt; nếu UI hỗ trợ&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Target&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Universal target: AWS SDK → Glue → &lt;code&gt;StartJobRun&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Input payload&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Dán JSON bên dưới&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Execution role&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;EventBridgeSchedulerStockScreenerRole&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;9&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Create schedule&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Kiểm tra schedule Enabled&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
